#. module: syscoon_financeinterface
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:syscoon_financeinterface.view_syscoon_financeinterface_template_form
msgid ""
"<span>\n"
"                                if you need to use python code in the force value field, you can use the following variables:<br/>\n"
"                                # Available variables:<br/>\n"
"                                #  - env: Odoo Environment on which the action is triggered<br/>\n"
"                                #  - current_value: value of the heading key of the line<br/>\n"
"                                #  - interface: Odoo Model of the templateModel on which the action is triggered; is a void recordset<br/>\n"
"                                #  - uid, user: current user id and record of the current user<br/>\n"
"                                #  - move: move record that is linked to this line while evaluated<br/>\n"
"                                #  - time, datetime, dateutil, timezone: useful Python libraries<br/>\n"
"                                #  - float_compare: Odoo function to compare floats based on specific precisions<br/><br/>\n"
"\n"
"                                # Example:<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = 'Static Value'<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = current_value and current_value[:6] or \"\"  # if you want to use the first 6 characters of the current value<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = current_value and current_value[2:] or \"\"  # if you want to use all characters of the current value except the first 2 characters<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = current_value and current_value[2:7] or \"\"  # if you want to use the characters 3 to 7 of the current value<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = (current_value or \"\").replace(\"/\", \"\")  # if you want to remove all slashes from the current value<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = (current_value or \"\").replace(\"-\", \"\")  # if you want to remove all dashes from the current value<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = (current_value or \"\").replace(\"_\", \"\")  # if you want to remove all underscores from the current value<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = interface.start_date<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = interface.end_date<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = move.ref or ''<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = move.partner_id.ref or ''<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = move.date and move.date.strftime('%Y-%m-%d') or ''<br/>\n"
"                            </span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>\n"
"                                Wenn Sie Python-Code im Feld 'Erzwungener Wert' verwenden möchten, können Sie folgende Variablen nutzen:<br/>\n"
"                                # Verfügbare Variablen:<br/>\n"
"                                #  - env: Odoo-Umgebung, in der die Aktion ausgelöst wird<br/>\n"
"                                #  - current_value: Wert des Überschriftenschlüssels der Zeile<br/>\n"
"                                #  - interface: Odoo-Modell des Vorlagenmodells, in dem die Aktion ausgelöst wird; ist ein leeres Recordset<br/>\n"
"                                #  - uid, user: Aktuelle Benutzer-ID und Datensatz des aktuellen Benutzers<br/>\n"
"                                #  - move: Buchungsdatensatz, der beim Auswerten mit dieser Zeile verknüpft ist<br/>\n"
"                                #  - time, datetime, dateutil, timezone: Nützliche Python-Bibliotheken<br/>\n"
"                                #  - float_compare: Odoo-Funktion zum Vergleichen von Gleitkommazahlen mit bestimmten Genauigkeiten<br/><br/>\n"
"\n"
"                                # Beispiel:<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = 'Statischer Wert'<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = current_value and current_value[:6] or \"\"  # Wenn Sie die ersten 6 Zeichen des aktuellen Werts verwenden möchten<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = current_value and current_value[2:] or \"\"  # Wenn Sie alle Zeichen außer den ersten 2 verwenden möchten<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = current_value and current_value[2:7] or \"\"  # Wenn Sie die Zeichen 3 bis 7 verwenden möchten<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = (current_value or \"\").replace(\"/\", \"\")  # Wenn Sie alle Schrägstriche entfernen möchten<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = (current_value or \"\").replace(\"-\", \"\")  # Wenn Sie alle Bindestriche entfernen möchten<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = (current_value or \"\").replace(\"_\", \"\")  # Wenn Sie alle Unterstriche entfernen möchten<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = interface.start_date<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = interface.end_date<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = move.ref or ''<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = move.partner_id.ref or ''<br/>\n"
"                                #  - value = move.date and move.date.strftime('%Y-%m-%d') or ''<br/>\n"
"                            </span>"

